    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Nagiev confronts Vika about her fake excuse and forces her to pay for the trip herself. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'kind' and 'morning' — you will catch every word right away. See you in the next scene.",
